====Noun====
{{yo-noun|ìbó}}

# The name for several plants of the family [[Apocynaceae]] that are known for their sour taste. They include {{taxlink|Landolphia dulcis|species}}, {{taxlink|Ancylobotrys scandens|species}} (from the genus {{taxlink|Ancylobothrys|genus}}), {{taxlink|Saba comorensis|species}}, {{w|Landolphia owariensis|species}}, and {{taxlink|Saba thompsonii|species}}.
#: {{uxi|yo|ẹmu náàá kan bí '''ìbó'''|t=the palm wine was as sour as the '''ìbó plant'''}}
# {{lb|yo|euphemism}} [[death]]
#: {{uxi|yo|ọmọ́ lọ ká '''ìbó'''|The child is '''dead'''|lit=The child went and picked the '''ìbó plant'''}}

